# Protocol 26 — Proceed Confirmation

Manifest: `docs/operations/agent-proceed-confirmation.md`

After `pnpm agent:next-work`, issue **Proceed Brief** then start work unless **stop** / **correct:** / approval gate.

Forbidden: "Which should I do?" / "Option A or B?" / menus instead of a recommendation.
